        <product:full_desc>Upgrade to Planetary Pack incudes the following:
- Pan-Pan soundtrack
- An Explorers Guide
- a game code for Pid

Pan-Pan is an open plain adventure that expands on the concept of environmental narrative storytelling with puzzle solving and exploration elements at its core.
Set against a backdrop of soothing ambient sounds crafted by renowned sound composer Simon Viklund, your task is to fix your downed spaceship and begin the pilgrimage home.</product:full_desc>
