        <product:full_desc>This is the original soundtrack to Ne no Kami - The Two Princess Knights of Kyoto.

This soundtrack features 13 tracks including the theme song Waltz of the Princess Knights of Kyoto sung by vocalist Yuriko Himekusa as well as a bonus arrange track by Emmanuel Lagumbay featuring Kristin Naigus on shakuhachi, English horn, and flute.

Tracklist

01. Waltz of the Princess Knights of Kyoto (Full Ver)
02. Consequence
03. Radiant Moonlight
04. The Turbulent Capital
05. Tsuchigumo
06. Spellbound
07. Tasogare Souka
08. Waltz of the Princess Knights of Kyoto (Part 1 Ver)
09. Waltz of the Princess Knights of Kyoto (Part 2 Ver)
10. Waltz of the Princess Knights of Kyoto (Off Vocal Ver)
11. Radiant Moonlight (Off Vocal Ver)
12. Tasogare Souka (Off Vocal Ver)
13. Waltz of the Princess Knights of Kyoto (Arrange Ver)

Soundtrack composed by: s_e_beat + Egawa Souichirou
01. Composed by s_e_beat + Egawa Souichirou, Lyrics: Fenrir Vier, Vocalist: Yuriko Himekusa
03. Composed by s_e_beat + Egawa Souichirou, Lyrics: Fenrir Vier, Vocalist: Mizuho
07. Composed by s_e_beat + Egawa Souichirou, Lyrics: Ruse Kazunari, Vocalist: ming-zi
13. Arrangement and additional music by: Emmanuel Lagumbay, Shakuhachi, English horn, and flute: Kristin Naigus</product:full_desc>
