        <product:has_tag rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/tag/third-person"/>
        <product:active rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</product:active>
        <product:cool_desc>An original, thrilling new addition in the franchise, with friends and foes both new and old.
10+ hours of exciting gameplay await you in an all new adventure set in the Two Worlds universe, in addition to myriad side-quests and optional missions. 
Highhly stylized armor and weapons create unlimited combat options, regardless of your play-style. Choose from a wide variety of axes, maces, daggers, swords and spears, in addition to ranged weapons like magical staves, bows and projectiles.
Explore the archipelago like never before; investigate new locations, from haunting crypts and swamps to sprawling villages, trading outposts and bandit camps.
A revolting new breed of evil lurks in the shadows, a horrifying species of rat-like zealots known as “The Chosen”!
Ferocious, towering bosses require fast reflexes and quick thinking in order to find and exploit their weaknesses. 
New enemy tactics and strategies will test your mettle and keep you guessing.
An epic soundtrack featuring over an hour of all new music, plus a bevy of new sound effects and thematic music. </product:cool_desc>
        <product:full_desc>At long last, it’s time to revisit the sprawling lands of Antaloor for another thrilling chapter in the Two Worlds saga! After the high-flying action of TW II: Pirates of the Flying Fortress, leave the skies behind and return to Antaloor for another exciting RPG adventure in this new DLC, Two Worlds 2: Call of the Tenebrae! 

The shocking murder of the hero’s most trusted ally, the half-orc DarPha, sets off a chain of events that uncovers a powerful new magic and a creeping evil with sinister designs for the inhabitants of Antaloor. Drawn into a battle between two warring leaders of a savage tribe of rat-like creatures known as “The Chosen”, the Hero has only a few short days to stop a twisted plan that will extinguish the light of Antaloor for good! 

Joined by familiar faces and new allies alike, you must unravel a genocidal plot that will destroy the harmony of Antaloor and leave its people and lands in ruins. A small town with a deadly secret and the discovery of powerful relics from a forgotten time leads to a shocking secret that threatens to change the face of Antaloor forever. 

Upgrade and equip sturdy new armor and powerful, deadly weapons in your fight against “The Chosen”. Battle your way through new lands and locations, from haunted graveyards and crypts, to dank swamps and dark forests swarming with vicious enemies. Harness the power of mystical crystals and brew new potions and concoctions with the expanded alchemy system to aid you in your quest. New combat techniques and enemy behaviors will keep you guessing, as you fight to uncover a secret that will rock Antaloor to its core. 

Welcome back to Two Worlds II!</product:full_desc>
        <product:id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1087704043</product:id>
        <product:is_pre_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</product:is_pre_order>
        <product:lead_desc>At long last, it’s time to revisit the sprawling lands of Antaloor for another thrilling chapter in the Two Worlds saga! After the high-flying action of TW II: Pirates of the Flying Fortress, leave the skies behind and return to Antaloor for another exciting RPG adventure in this new DLC, Two Worlds 2: Call of the Tenebrae!</product:lead_desc>
        <product:release_date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2017-07-07T15:59:00</product:release_date>
        <product:slug>two_worlds_ii_call_of_the_tenebrae_dlc</product:slug>
        <product:title>Two Worlds II: Call of the Tenebrae</product:title>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


