        <product:full_desc>Minions, rejoice! Here&apos;s the Supporter Pack, dedicated to all the human fans of Legend of Keepers around the world. Thank you very much mortal, as you&apos;re helping Goblinz Studio thrive.


People who bought the Supporter Edition of the Prologue will get this Pack for free!


In return for your support you will get:

