When the starship Pandora is shot down, James Hawkins finds himself trapped inside a military prototype Battle Frame armor as he hurtles towards Medusa-42.</product:lead_desc>
        <product:release_date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2022-01-19T23:50:00</product:release_date>
