Hello Neighbor is a stealth horror game about sneaking into your neighbor&apos;s house to figure out what horrible secrets he&apos;s hiding in the basement. You play against an advanced AI that learns from your every move.</product:lead_desc>
        <product:release_date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2017-12-08T19:40:00</product:release_date>
        <product:slug>hello_neighbor</product:slug>
        <product:title>Hello Neighbor</product:title>
