        <product:lead_desc>
Uncover the mysteries of Sveti Kotar
In this story-and-choice driven psychological horror detective game, you play as Benedek and Nikolay – two troubled godly men in search for their missing relative in an ancient God-devoted town called Sveti Kotar.</product:lead_desc>
