        <product:changelog>Update (08 November 2019)


added text support for the following languages: 


French


Italian


German


Spanish


Polish



Bonus Addition (07.02.2015)

We&apos;ve fixed the seemingly corrupted archive for the German version of the &quot;MDK - Making Of&quot; booklet.


Bonus Addition (05.31.2015)

We&apos;ve added the German version of the &quot;Making of MDK&quot; to your bonus goodies section.
Vielen Dank MarkoH01 for your donation!


Bonus Addition (05.29.2015)

We have added the &quot;Making of MDK&quot; booklet to your bonus goodies section.
Thank you lmfsilva for this rare and awesome treasure! :) 
</product:changelog>
        <product:cool_desc>One of the greatest and most memorable action games of all time
Fun and addictive gameplay, filled with humor - a trademark of games by Shiny Entertainment
To this day no one really knows what “MDK” actually stands for...</product:cool_desc>
        <product:full_desc>As vast alien mining cities suck the power and minerals from every major metropolis on Earth simultaneously, time is of the essence as millions of civilians are expiring by the second.Using your stealth parachute and the now infamous &quot;Zooming&quot; head-mounted sniper weapon, your task is to slip in undetected from the sky, seek out and remove the alien leader by any means. Fully reactive “smart enemies” think, listen and communicate in a calculated assault on your life. Think fast and act faster against the most sophisticated artificial enemy intelligence of its time.The main objective of the game is to basically shoot everything that moves and everything means every alien you will come across. The one and only way to stop the alien invasion is to kill&apos;em all by any means necessary, such as the smallest nuclear bomb, surfboard-like jet or bomber plane. Your goal is simple - repulse the alien invasion and save the Earth... almost single handedly.</product:full_desc>
        <product:id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</product:id>
        <product:is_pre_order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</product:is_pre_order>
        <product:lead_desc>As vast alien mining cities suck the power and minerals from every major metropolis on Earth simultaneously, time is of the essence as millions of civilians are expiring by the second.Using your stealth parachute and the now infamous &quot;Zooming&quot; head-mounted sniper weapon, your task is to slip in undetected from the sky, seek out and remove the alien leader by any means.</product:lead_desc>
        <product:release_date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">1991-12-25T00:00:00</product:release_date>
        <product:slug>mdk</product:slug>
        <product:title>MDK</product:title>
