        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2011-06-12T01:11:16</review:date>
        <review:description>The game has a good combat system/soundtrack and I highly recommend it to a person fond of Diablo 2 style single player games, the story can be a tad flaky at times but if you don&apos;t take it too seriously you will find it entertaining.</review:description>
