        <review:description>A very fun game. I&apos;d love to see more.
My only slight criticism is that I feel like the games ends a bit too soon and some of the stories would be awesome if they lasted a bit longer and you could dig a little deeper into their back story and into the interactions.

It has great replayability value.</review:description>
