        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2022-06-16T10:33:44</review:date>
        <review:description>It&apos;s not a Stardew ripoff, but very much it&apos;s own crafting-centered game. With voice-acting and 3D graphics (that&apos;s a mixed bag). It&apos;s designed for controller, making it a great solo couch game. (no multi-player, that would have been nice)

If you like building/creating games, this should be in your pocket. Esp on sale.


</review:description>
