        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2019-06-22T22:25:37</review:date>
        <review:description>I loved the gameplay in this game, it felt so cool doing flips in the air and then shooting someone. It is just fun to play. On the other hand though it shoves its unfunny humor down your throat, it has a 2012 internet &apos;le random&apos; sense of humor that is completely unfunny and annoying.</review:description>
