        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2014-06-08T18:36:21</review:date>
        <review:description>This game was even better then i had deared dream of! I strongly recommend it to all flight simulator fans. The game doesn&apos;t stop at flying and attacking. You can (and sometimes really should) change focus on speed, shields and weapons in combat. And commanding wings, escorts, etc all in the heat of battle. If only they would make a FREESPACE 3 for pc, PS4 and Xbox One...</review:description>
