        <review:description>Very good and enjoyable game, it does not copy Heroes III, it goes it´s own way and i think that is good. Heroes had it´s own problems and i look forward to playing a game with a different mindset due to different gameplay.

Only minus = Pixel artwork is beautifull, but low poly i would like to see more pixels (more detailed models)</review:description>
