        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2012-04-06T05:14:00</review:date>
        <review:description>Almost 13 years later and countless games after originally purchasing this in a brick and mortar store on launch day, it&apos;s still my favorite game of all time.

There is also an open source launcher for the game that makes it a little more Windows 7 friendly. ^_^</review:description>
