        <review:description>Well one thing about me is, all the games I&apos;ve played till this day  ,i have completed all. but, this one at first is really interesting and has a great story line but as soon as u leave Barcelona the intellectual missions  ends the game is all physical and boring ,it looses its uniqueness. It has a bad and unsatisfying ending.</review:description>
