        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2009-02-23T15:33:18</review:date>
        <review:description>I played this game years ago with my buddies, but then we all upgraded our machines and lost all this old stuff. It&apos;s so great to have found a copy of this floating around!!!</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</review:downvotes>
