        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2019-10-25T19:44:27</review:date>
        <review:description>This game is so unusual that it&apos;ll take some getting used to, but it&apos;s well worth it. One of the most enjoyable FPS games ever made. It&apos;s full of humor, and weirdness, and just entertaining as hell.

Also, it&apos;s so highly linear that it reduces the action to a simple imperative. Kill everything. It doesn&apos;t require much thinking, just action and fun.</review:description>
