        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-09-18T18:43:34</review:date>
        <review:description>I played a demo for over an hour now and I really enjoyed it. There&apos;s not much to do after this hour but I hope developers will add more features to the gameplay loop. After a certain amount of people visiting the resort, the game started to lag when zoom in on the resort center.</review:description>
