        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-01-15T08:27:16</review:date>
        <review:description>Don&apos;t misunderstand, this is a great game with a good story. It just suffers from a difficulty scale problem. It becomes too easy too quickly. Add to this that this revamped version has crashing problems-- enough that I&apos;m annoyed enough to write about it. Crashes require a computer reboot, which is frustrating</review:description>
