        <review:description>I played Kingpin... Eighteen years ago. Whoah. Time flies. Anyway, my point, and to be brief, is that it&apos;s a not-too-memorable Half-Life 1 reskin, in which you fight junkies instead of aliens. Best ignore.</review:description>
