        <review:description>freespace has been a game that i just can&apos;t live without...okay mabye thats a bit to much, but regardless, it&apos;s a game i&apos;ve played over and over. the only oghter space simlulator fighter that i can think of that comes close to it would have to be its prediceser(...i spelled that wrong) freespace 2. i just hope there are more games like it comeing out</review:description>
