    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/bf41c532-54dd-11ec-98ab-fa163e99870e -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/bf41c532-54dd-11ec-98ab-fa163e99870e">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-12-04T10:39:51</review:date>
        <review:description>Okay this is a great game. Seriously funny chars, stereotype hilarious ( more or less) dialogs. I bought directly a second time because of DRM. I had a good time. And thanx god my wife is okay with my humor, so I dont need to sit in a dark chamber like some guys maybe need to do.

and as usual if youre unsure check YT or else ^^

---------------Next part is just my (!) personal opinion, aside from the game----
Anyway.. :
For sure I awaited, like the reviews of some other &quot;similar&quot; games, the first indignant squeekin hypocrite who maybe love to play games with endless violence, killin thousands of whatsoever ingame creatures, playin cruel horror games, watchin thriller movies and so on.. 

But!
Dismbering bodies =good/ fuckin bodies =bad? 

Naked skin is still a thing in the 21. century?? And sex too? Gettin blush or pale? Do you think your god will eat your willie because youre watchin stuff like this? Goddamit crawl back in your cave and whip your back in shame because you looked at things wich your mum stuffed into your mouth to feed you. Ouh and dont forget to cry and pray..

Sry for the hard words, but since I can think of, there a guys who really got a **** problem with their own sexuality. So boring. And I&apos;m so! fed up readin this primitive arrogant stupid bs. Please visit a psychologist/ therapist and ask them whats wrong with you...

The game is well made. Just fun. The sex thing is sort of taste so if you dont like titties or sex, sry for you. At least buy a game here instead of writing about things you anyway dont like or play.
</review:description>
