        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2018-10-02T18:42:20</review:date>
        <review:description>I love this game. 10 year old me found the puzzles here vastly superior to those in the Tomb Raider games. More exploration/logic oriented rather than the frantic &quot;what did I miss?&quot; guess work in the TR series.

That being said, the control is ... weird, at best. Horrible, by any modern standards. I think they were bad even by Win98 standard. I play this game with the keyboard exclusively, since I can&apos;t seem to get a handle on the way it behaves on a Xbox controller</review:description>
