        <review:description>this game, when it comes out, is gonna make you mad very mad but prolly in a good way. typing and dodging bullets is no joke! lmao. i hate the crazy bullet dodging games but this seems fun. i&apos;ll prolly buy it if it&apos;s not more than....30 bucks or something crazy like that. and why on earth does recommended specs say 4GB of RAM??? the game itself is only 250MB..... (╯°□°）╯︵ ┻━┻</review:description>
