        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2009-02-27T20:54:32</review:date>
        <review:description>this was the most action-packed, explosion filled laser-shooting frenzy I have ever played, I would recommend this to anybody who likes seeing explosions and testosterone fueled dogfights.</review:description>
