        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-12-02T23:10:06</review:date>
        <review:description>For those of you unable to play the game after the initial cinematic because of the game being unable to go full screen. Simply change your screen resolution to 1024 x 768 and select caracter size 100%. The game launched perfectly well after thoses changes.</review:description>
