        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2019-09-27T19:05:22</review:date>
        <review:description>i&apos;m running windows 7 x64
i tried to use compatibility mode for windows xp, sp3
i&apos;ve tried all the compatibility mode options
however, the game crashes in both native 7 x64, and also in xp mode
i&apos;m wondering if anyone knows of a way to get this game to work
the only thing i haven&apos;t tried is using virtualization because setting up a virtual machine is such a tedious chore</review:description>
