        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-05-26T17:18:25</review:date>
        <review:description>Overall it&apos;s a really fun game. Really interesting stuff going on especially in the first half of the game. But halfway through it can becomes a bit, hmm, difficult, but not in a good way. But I still like it, it&apos;s a new experience for me. 7/10.</review:description>
