        <review:description>I stoped after something like 2 hours.
You start with a ship who strangely have 3 cannons on his board but can only shoot 1 bullet at time.
The targeting system is awfull (straight line).
It takes something like 20 bullets to destroy 1 small ship.
In 2 hours I&apos;ve only destroyed the tutorial ennemy!

I&apos;ll go back on sid meier&apos;s pirates</review:description>
