        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2011-08-20T19:38:36</review:date>
        <review:description>A really cool game for space sim addicts like me,  the expansion is a little buggy, but playable.. IMO, StarLancer and Tachyon (The Fringe) are way better in graphics and story line. I wish GOG would add these two great games to their arsenal..
FS2 is another thing though.. 
Don&apos;t get me wrong, FS1 is very cool. If you&apos;re into these kind of games, get it without hesitation!</review:description>
