        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2016-09-18T01:35:16</review:date>
        <review:description>It could use some polish. I thoroughly enjoyed my first 30 minutes or so, but the collision detection / timing became a source of frustration as I went along. I stopped playing at one particular puzzle in the third act.</review:description>
