        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-12-08T02:07:06</review:date>
        <review:description>It was sad ages ago when my computer was too fast to play this game and for years I searched for a way to play it again. For a long time I waited for GoG to publish and now it has! Thank You! and to those who have not played before, please enjoy :) it is a great point and click adventure just when voice acting in games was a new thing.</review:description>
