        <review:description>This is bittersweet.

MDK is one of my favourite games. There&apos;s really nothing else like it. Well worth it.

The worst thing though, is that I have a Mac and I&apos;m guessing it was a 32bit game so won&apos;t play on my computer since I updated it.

Absolutely gutted. But I suppose that&apos;s my fault for being a ponce.

In summary... Buy this game.

And developers... Remakes are the in thing at the moment... Just saying!</review:description>
