        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-09-15T14:01:21</review:date>
        <review:description>To my surprise I found this here on GOG while browsing for anything that is not in my library already. Like others, I have this on Android, and certainly I could just play the Android version through Bluestacks but decided to pick up the GOG version to support the dev.

Hopefully we will so some other games from the dev. Until then, I am going to enjoy a great one man rpg. Reminds me of Jeff from Spiderweb Software, also an independent dev that creates really great rpgs.

Glad to see this one here.</review:description>
