        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-03-08T14:14:11</review:date>
        <review:description>One of the most fun, fast-paced games I&apos;ve played recently. I think the demo is short for people who won&apos;t replay the levels, but its free and I can&apos;t recomend trying it out enough! I saw some reviews saying the graphics are bad (?). I don&apos;t think the graphics are the focus. I have a GTX 770 ATM and got 500 FPS, so its super optimised for fast action.</review:description>
