        <review:description>I must admit I was a bit sceptical at first, given the game&apos;s different graphics and gameplay. I love story driven games, but I am more of an RPG kind of guy. However I took a gamble when this game went on sale and boy do I wish I had it full price. 

I won&apos;t spoil things for you, but this game will have you griped and hooked in seconds and you will be desperate to understand what was teh fate of obra dim.

Buy it now! </review:description>
