        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-03-16T05:22:16</review:date>
        <review:description>I really wish I could give game a higher score.  I absolutely love the concept and the art. It&apos;s even got visible cues for sound things from the game for those who cannot hear. Now, I&apos;m not great with puzzle games sometimes, and this was one of them. When I got the clues (2/3 of the time) it was a really great feeling, but when I was stu</review:description>
