    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/cef1acc4-93ff-11e8-9865-00163e97122a -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/cef1acc4-93ff-11e8-9865-00163e97122a">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2010-09-29T17:11:45</review:date>
        <review:description>i enjoyed this game and it was very good at its time in terms of graphics and controls...everything is almost perfect....

but the thing which is missing is the personal touch....all the things which made wing commander great....fellow wingmen....a continous plot.....real characters....

this game feels like a series of nice missions but nor really as a good space opera action story....
i only say this that you don&apos;t expect something this game don&apos;t offer....
it is great and i recommend it...but don&apos;t expect wing commander.....</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</review:downvotes>
