        <review:description>I you remember and liked the Wing Commander series then you will also like Freespace. Compared to Wing Commander, Freespace IMO has a much better history.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</review:downvotes>
