        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-03-14T10:36:05</review:date>
        <review:description>This little add-on (DLC) is pretty cool. Gotta give it 5 stars for what it is. A bunch more casting baits with a name brand stamped on.
I don&apos;t suppose you really need it for the game but hey, if you&apos;re a fisherman like I am, why not?
It&apos;s on sale as of this writing so it is worth it. Go for it!
I recommend it. :-)</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</review:downvotes>
