        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2012-07-26T21:17:58</review:date>
        <review:description>Oh my God!!!! I loooooved this game when I first played it on the iMac when it debuted! It was my first &quot;new generation&quot; welcome into gaming from the arcade days. Ooooh the memories!</review:description>
