        <review:description>i got to a point in the game where after doing a main story quest i could not finish as there was no way to exit after killing the boss, i looked to it up to find its been there since 2018, 4 years and not fixed, i got the game on sell, and now i dont want to touch it, waste of money on lazy developers, 4 years,,,no. </review:description>
