        <review:description>I don&apos;t have much to add, except that i actually like the briefings in this game.  Probably sounds weird, but the briefings are cool.  They have really good voice actors, are fairly detailed of your objectives, allow you to see 3D models of ships that will appear, and include snippets of video.  They are also one of the main places to find out about the story.</review:description>
