        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2017-09-22T18:12:17</review:date>
        <review:description>I&apos;m a sucker for games that use music and sound in new and interesting ways, so Figment was right up my alley! Combine that with some finely tuned puzzles and a surprisingly mature storyline, and you got yourself a very unique game to enjoy. I know I did.</review:description>
