        <review:description>... is basically what it is, but in a good way. Yes, a lot of the game is really about making your pawns/dorfs do things in the right order, but it is really satisfying having a functioning fort. Colony, sorry.

Not five stars because that would indicate a perfect game and there ain&apos;t no such thing.</review:description>
