        <review:title>Crashes still exist</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">9</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/e14ed372-55d3-11eb-b83f-fa163e9aa6fa -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/e14ed372-55d3-11eb-b83f-fa163e9aa6fa">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-01-13T21:16:47</review:date>
        <review:description>I was expecting something more into the romanian folklore but first one hour and a half were quite awkward. 
The english voice acting has nothing to do with the theme of the game. The romanian translation is quite funny and cool but it cannot be paired with romanian voice acting because it does not exist.
The combat is basic and nothing to write home to your girlfriend about..
The story seems interesting but kindof thrown around.
The graphics are very nice but sometimes too much stuff on the screen can make you tired.
Overall.. nothing too special.. get it on sale only.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">28</review:downvotes>
