        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2017-05-12T14:46:36</review:date>
        <review:description>If the game fails to start and does not report an error - it&apos;s probably because you are running the game on older Intel GPU. I reported this to GOG but they refuse to refund! So be warned!</review:description>
