        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2022-01-02T01:52:43</review:date>
        <review:description>Normies hated the original&apos;s unique but traditional design. In response they made the sequel the most by the numbers, conventional thing, imaginable. I hate it. This game is just The Last Of Us with a Evil Within reskin. Shinji Mikami be like &quot;oh you normies don&apos;t see my vision? Fine, I won&apos;t have anything to do with actually making the sequel. You can eat what these unimaginative Bethesda morons give you lol&quot; Shinji plz come back, I need you . . .</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</review:downvotes>
