        <review:description>Enjoyed the laughs from reviewers who don&apos;t understand the words they are throwing around and whining about. Giving this 5 stars jus to piss off all of the Fa sobbing about AntiFa; cry harder fascist scum! </review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">28</review:downvotes>
