    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/ee4671d2-5a0f-11e9-9008-00163e97122a -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/ee4671d2-5a0f-11e9-9008-00163e97122a">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2019-04-08T18:06:48</review:date>
        <review:description>This DLC isn&apos;t too bad.  The story is kind of interesting.  The content is pretty short.  I finished it in about 7 or so hours and I was taking my time.  The companions you get kind of suck which makes the last dungeon annoying.  All in all I&apos;d recommend it if you can get it at about half price.  I don&apos;t think it&apos;s worth the 15 CAD I paid for it.  </review:description>
