        <review:description>Ok so this with the free addon&apos;s (community provided) is really a current game.
In the absence of Wing commander 5 or FreeSpace 3 this is it.
If anyone can point me at a better looking current spacesim then please do because I don&apos;t know of any.
Till EA give WingCommander a new look this is it!</review:description>
