        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-09-28T12:35:43</review:date>
        <review:description>Got more out of this game than I expected, 50+ hours and still having fun. 
If you like grinding and collecting loot in a satisfying rpg world you&apos;ll probably enjoy Exiled Kingdoms.
On the plus side it also got a helpful forum and fleshed out wiki and the dev is still active and promised to to do some updates in 2020/2021. Totally worth the money, did not regret to buy.</review:description>
