        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2019-07-06T21:49:53</review:date>
        <review:description>I have rarely played anything as cool as My friend Pedro. I felt like Neo in the Matrix movie. Plus the driving electro soundtrack. Definitely worth playing.</review:description>
