        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2013-06-18T18:41:57</review:date>
        <review:description>This is one of the best space sims I ever played. The controls are smooth. The atmosphere of the game is tense. The missions sometimes frightening serious.</review:description>
