        <review:description>
It entertains, but there is no challenge. It is boring and the Spanish translation is not good.

I hope, beyond chapter 3, to find an improvement, if not a disappointment.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</review:downvotes>
