        <review:description>the game looks good for a early development. but not the level of a Simcity of a City Skyline. the resource magement is wierd to build zone you have to own wood, and your residents need food so you have to build farms by laying down roads. it&apos;s a little bit wierd. 

what i want to say is that the game needs a lot of work and rethink some choices.</review:description>
