        <review:description>This game is so good. The game is as complicated as you want it to be. It has endless replayability and even when losing you don&apos;t feel frustrated. 
The random events are very fun and sometimes threatening. 
I&apos;ve played this game for 50 hours and i bought it three days ago.</review:description>
