        <review:description>France, you&apos;ve got Jean-Michel Jarre, you&apos;ve got Air, you&apos;ve got Daft Punk and you&apos;ve got Danger. You set the directions. MP3 quality of Haven Soundtrack on GOG is top - 320 kbps (album size 209 MB). Enjoy!</review:description>
