        <review:description>I am terrible with platformers. I consider pixels the bane of modern graphical design.
This game became an exception. It&apos;s beautiful and has really smooth gameplay, while immersing the player into the atmosphere. Even though I&apos;d still consider it being beautiful not because of pixels but despite them, it&apos;s a work of art.</review:description>
