        <review:description>The subject says it all.  Nothing gets you amped up like hearing those bad boys start blasting stuff to bits all around you.  I love this game.  I am a huge fan of the Wing Commander series and I hate to say it, but this one trumps them all in my opinion.  It is easily the best space sim out there to date period.</review:description>
