        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2022-01-20T05:50:08</review:date>
        <review:description>Combat is fun and punchy with some nice environmental destruction but the camera can get pretty bad sometimes especially in outdoor environments and platforming feels really janky</review:description>
