        <review:description>As iiee said, this is now a dead gender, but it went out with a HUGE BANG! Proof of it is Freespace series.


?? Why are you reading this, get the game and play, omg XD</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>0fa65e70-93fd-11e8-869b-00163e97122a</review:id>
