    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/02ebbd04-944a-11e8-8cb9-00163e97122a -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/02ebbd04-944a-11e8-8cb9-00163e97122a">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2010-10-01T04:59:51</review:date>
        <review:description>Truly a piece of gaming art that manages to add fast action, puzzles and a dark sense of humor into a wonderful 3rd person action game.

First time i played this was back at release when i was still a kid and even then i realized how ahead of other games it were.
This game have insane render distances compared to other games of the time and even managed to &quot;fake&quot; mirror like surfaces ( fake in the term that the player and the enemies and items dont reflect )

The bosses is varied, the levels are exotic, the story..... errr... you are going to save the world by killing aliens. 

However, as for players that never played games before the &quot;standard&quot; settings for movement might have a slight problem getting used to the controls and the camera might be a little dodgy in a flew places. 

All in all, it is a short but quite interesting and entertaining game, Shiny did do their best in making this a epic game beyond its time and gave us something else.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>02ebbd04-944a-11e8-8cb9-00163e97122a</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</review:rating>
        <review:title>Beyond its time</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/023d69e8-dfac-11ea-b20b-fa163e93294d -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/023d69e8-dfac-11ea-b20b-fa163e93294d">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-08-16T13:34:05</review:date>
        <review:description>Станьте свидетелем широкого спектра способов &quot;оптимизации&quot; экипажа и пассажиров высокодетализированного парусника. Прочувствуйте всю &quot;радость&quot; пребывания всех рас и сословий общества в замкнутом пространстве. В качестве пикантной приправы добавьте мистики.

Вся игра состоит из процесса детального &quot;обсасывания&quot; объемных стоп-кадаров с моментом выпиливания очередного несчастного, где Вам предстоит разобраться и отметить Ху Из Ху, и Хау Ху кончил.
Потрясающая работа от мэтра, автора Pappers Please.
С нетерпением жду какого-то продолжения с поездом/самолетом и другими местами концентрации человеков.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>023d69e8-dfac-11ea-b20b-fa163e93294d</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</review:rating>
        <review:title>Нелинейный детектив/квест/судоку</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


