    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/067ed6b8-f9bf-11ea-aeb7-fa163edf6d96 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/067ed6b8-f9bf-11ea-aeb7-fa163edf6d96">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-09-18T17:55:43</review:date>
        <review:description>No matter how low you set the graphics options, the game still stutters.
Tried playing with video set to &apos;windowed&apos; as well. No change.
Still stuttering at 800x600, windowed.
You die a lot because of the stuttering, nothing you can do about it.

This is acting like a console game, poorly ported to the PC.</review:description>
