        <review:description>Why would anyone want to play as these Antifa/BLM terrorist commie unamerican wimps? I mean if it was actual patriots taking these true facists down, then heck yeah im in! Im so glad that i didn&apos;t have to pay a penny for it, im not sure if i should have excepted for free, its just a commie poop stain in my GOG library i need to rub off! But it is what it is! Unless if i have time to play and dump on this game. That&apos;s all i got to say!</review:description>
