        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-07-10T23:00:56</review:date>
        <review:description>I have no nostalgia for this game. There is pretty good unofficial patch to get the modern widescreen resolutions working, but the gameplay is just horrible. Shooting is so crap and takes the fun out of the game. Level design is meh and game is lacking in giving players some guidance to get the gameplay basics familiar. Maybe the coming reloaded version will make this even playable, but as it is, this is not worth it. </review:description>
