    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/2be9c724-9a09-11eb-a5b7-fa163e99870e -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/2be9c724-9a09-11eb-a5b7-fa163e99870e">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-04-10T17:29:34</review:date>
        <review:description>I first thought that this game is about doing some quests and catching a murderer. I was so wrong! 

The atmosphere is really catching since the beginning, there are so many types of people and creatures and every character is really complex and has its own story to tell. You never know if they are good or bad, if they are telling the truth or simply want to gain something from you.

This game is like no other that I have ever played. When you talk to someone or get a quest, you have to think through it. Is it worth it? Why? For what? What if you just take the stuff and run away? Do they want to betray you? Do you want to betray them? Do you even want to do this at all? You will be scared, mad, frustrated, but it will not let you sleep at night until you finish the story. Because the story is just incredible.

And yes, this game is really difficult, but you can change every aspect in your settings and focus more on the story, which I really appreciated. 

Don&apos;t give up after first day, the game is not as chaotic as it seems at first.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>2be9c724-9a09-11eb-a5b7-fa163e99870e</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</review:rating>
        <review:title>Challenging, but brilliant</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


