        <review:description>I was looking for a game, like this, and when it came out - this was a surprise. Even bigger surprise was that the game is very optimised, fun and beautiful. Gameplay is interesting and not irritating, challenging to the level of not making you tear your hairs out, but making you want to paly it. Awesome game. I hope there will be a continuation. My 6 y.o. kid loves it, me neither.</review:description>
