        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2010-05-28T04:47:17</review:date>
        <review:description>Yes get a Joystick if you want to enjoy this great game. I´ve been trying to play it with a mouse but It´s no fun. I know this game will show all its potential once I get a joystick.

Regarding the game... It´s just great for its price, the graphics are really good for the present times.

You can play it on a laptop without problems, I&apos;m playing it on my 2005 laptop and it runs pretty well.

REMEMBER, GET A JOYSTICK.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</review:downvotes>
