        <review:description>Installed the game on my second PC - and now i&apos;m unable to play the Bad Seed DLC.
It is paid and I can see it enabled in DLC list in GOG game settings. but reinstalling and file check do nothing, i tried it several times - no result. I also lost access to all previously unlocked stuff from the Bad Seed and it&apos;s a huge disappointment. As I can see in recent reviews, several months are not enough to fix this? Great job, guys, great job.
