        <review:description>5 stars because they use there own custom engine and Shiro is very community driven.
Played the game since alpha and often play it again. Very good setting, story and mechanics. Can&apos;t wait to see more titles from Shiro. If you love RTS games, Northgard is the game to play.</review:description>
