        <review:description>Hamfisted, sad and actually also not that interesting.

This is a game like many other &quot;activist message&quot; based games...

Same as most activist-message based games also.

Extremely generic and with more focus on the message than the gameplay :/.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">188</review:downvotes>
