        <review:description>Oh-oh~ I&apos;m so glad to have found this! I was pretty eager to buy it the moment I saw the trailer! The story is a tad expositional, but the gameplay is amazing!
If you guys could please make more Ninja Gaide-like stuff I&apos;d love it, and I would also ask if I could buy the music at some point in the future? Thanks a lot! GGWP!</review:description>
