        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2008-09-10T11:41:56</review:date>
        <review:description>I played this game when it first released on 1998 and absolutely loved it. I am a big Starlancer, Freelancer and Wing Commander fan and this game gave me that I needed. Thanks Interplay and Volition and great thanks to GOG for giving us a chance to play this awesome game again. If you are loving space sims go and buy this game and Freespace 2. I hope Volition and THQ will make new Freelancer game for it`s fans.</review:description>
