Music fits,  Controls are burdensome on game pad, AI seems to have very little attention paid to it. Its not that good of a game, couldn&apos;t hold me past 2 levels. 2 stars for effort. 

Better free brawlers out there that aren&apos;t so degenerate at being degenerate.

