        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-05-14T08:20:48</review:date>
        <review:description>so political bs inspiring communist riots aside, the game just is actually not good. thankfull i didnt pay money for it, since i got it as the free gog game thing. 

ultra repetitive mindless clicking is all you do. save your cash and dont play this unless its free</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">29</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>24333364-b474-11eb-a43b-fa163e3a9b6e</review:id>
