        <review:description>This game surprised me quite a bit. It&apos;s just really, really fun to play. The gameplay is excellent and the design is amazing. MDK is a very creative game, in every sense. It actually looks great, even today. This one definitely gets my seal of approval. Pick it up, you won&apos;t regret it!</review:description>
