        <review:description>Game might be great, but gog does not recieve any of the newer updates. This shows how paying customers are treated aside from the &quot;big boy STEAM&quot; platform. 

Do youself a favor and do not buy this anywhere, until they start actually treating their customers fairly.</review:description>
