        <review:description>A sequel that does depart a lot from the original games design, but I would say it is for the better, the amount of content on offer for this game on Akuma is around 20-25 hours if you wanna get all the good gear. Combat has been streamlined for the better, and a lot of the weapons are very well made. First person mode makes the second time going through this game a very enjoyable time. </review:description>
