        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2012-04-20T11:54:37</review:date>
        <review:description>Hands down, the best space sim of all time.  I&apos;m all about the freespace modding that has been done but seriously... it&apos;s time for a reboot of the franchise.  Not a single worth while first-person space sim out in years.  Not a single good sci-fi show on tv right now.  Huge potential here for a reboot/sequel.  There&apos;s a reason why this is constistantly in the top 3/top 5 games on gog.com.</review:description>
