        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2010-05-31T09:25:25</review:date>
        <review:description>This game starts off looking like a champion, with a classic RPG style and interesting graphics and characters (like Leonardo da Vinci) which quickly becomes a lonely, drab, brown-toned clickfest. I can&apos;t imagine why its rating is so high here.</review:description>
