    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/40af0cb2-ab92-11e9-af71-465fb7337ac1 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/40af0cb2-ab92-11e9-af71-465fb7337ac1">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2019-07-21T08:33:45</review:date>
        <review:description>I am really glad I bought this at huge discount for just 2 Euros. Boring gameplay which didn´t know if it wants to be a shooter, strategy or stealth game. But all feel broken or just unfinished. Story is B like, but better than the gameplay. When you are playing FE:S you ask your self a lot if the developers wanted you to enjoy the game or just make you angry playing it at every turn.  Only good thing about the game is the cellshading graphics, which give the game distinct style and feel.  Definitely don´t buy for full price and consider just watching the story on youtube to spare yourself the suffering gameplay.</review:description>
