        <review:description>I really didn&apos;t like half genie hero and was very hesitant about buying this game because of it. But this game is fanatastic and I&apos;m very glad to see the return of quality shantae games</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</review:downvotes>
