    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/4569a404-2a05-11eb-8396-fa163e99870e -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/4569a404-2a05-11eb-8396-fa163e99870e">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-11-19T03:19:29</review:date>
        <review:description>Hi guys I must addmit I been put off due to the fact that it was behide steam now as of November 2020 it now caught up. I beileve GOG is about 2/3 months behide on updates from STEAM and yes the extra DLC isnt on gog however this is just small thing in the grand scheme of things as this was exclusive to STEAM.

Anyway now thats address on tot he game what can I say it amazing. I love it spent more then 50+ Hours there so much to see and do. Also the NPCS feel like they have some depth to them they all want to enjoy time with you and the one you cxan marry you really date for example go out for meal or chat and there friends in turn become your friends.

It hard to start with but becomes eaiser over time I wish I had bit more info at the start but this minor gripe. As stated yes this was behide Steam by about 3 months but as of now is totally caught up and with the next game due out next year well the future looks bright as I say lots of fun lot replay value just basicly amazing game I got it in the sale for £10 totally worth it if you like the old Harvest Moon or Stardrew valley then you love this:)</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>4569a404-2a05-11eb-8396-fa163e99870e</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</review:rating>
        <review:title>Love this game Also now upto date</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">17</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/45714be8-e08a-11e9-93e0-62257406b70a -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/45714be8-e08a-11e9-93e0-62257406b70a">
