        <review:description>How can you play something like this that requires so many controls for the most miniscule functions of the ship? Even the mouse support doesn&apos;t seem to work, atleast right off the bat. Seems to be bound in the controls settings. I will now go play Everspace, a real fun, dynamic, to the point space action game. 1 Downvote = 1 wrong person expressing opinions.</review:description>
