        <review:description>First off, great game, but really, get the second.

get FSO installed and then get the mod for this game to be played in that game, which is free.

https://www.gog.com/game/freespace_2
http://www.fsoinstaller.com/

great game and all, but can be done in the second game for free and with improved graphics, looking more like 2014 rather than &apos;98.</review:description>
