        <review:description>this is probally the best space combat simulator of all time ive played alot includeing some of the wing commander series and this supases them. i wish the genre wasnt all but dead and that someone would come out with a freespace three to help wrap the story up and explain things like why the shivians caused a sun to go super nova.</review:description>
