        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2012-12-22T22:58:01</review:date>
        <review:description>I remember buying this when it  first came out in 2000, sadly time has not been  kind to the very code of this game and on modern operating systems both my CD copy AND my GOG release are rendered  useless  by today&apos;s O.S. choices.
Buy this if you&apos;re feeling brave as  it really is a crapshoot if it will run for you. if it does  it&apos;s great , otherwise  it&apos;s a gamble.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</review:downvotes>
