        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2010-10-07T17:01:11</review:date>
        <review:description>No game has the art and style to match MDK, dark and sinister, killing countless foes while being fun and humorous. 

Gameplay ranging from desolate silence to intense action when something triggers the chaos. Puts you on the edge of your seat before you know it and can suddenly leave you confused or gobsmacked.

A classic in the ranks with Fallout, Baldur&apos;s Gate, Sacrifice...</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</review:downvotes>
