        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2009-01-10T18:07:47</review:date>
        <review:description>Its hard to write a negative review for any game, easier is to highlight good points or bash any errors...

The focus of the game is in the fighter vs fighter arena, there is practially only ONE fight between capital ships, this translates into a big flaw...

No EPIC battles: If you ever played TIE Fighter, you will know what it means to fight between three or four capital ships firing each other.

Plus the story is kind of cheesy.</review:description>
