        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2008-10-28T15:01:14</review:date>
        <review:description>In my opinion, THE greatest single-player space sim ever created (yes, even beats out X-Wing vs Tie Fighter).

For updated graphics, you can use the Freespace 2 Open Source Project but you must own the original game.  So, get this, install, then go get the Freespace 2 SCP.

Two thumbs way way up!</review:description>
