        <review:description>Okay, so I have Outward and The Soroboreans DLC, but not Three Brothers since:

A.  Most people said that the Three Brothers DLC sucks
B.  It has co-op that requires Galaxy to connect (DRM, does nobody remember direct connection via IP addresses!?  ipconfig)
C.  Three Brothers is $20.  This shit is $40.  I&apos;ve already spent that, so screw this update that has DRM, is overpriced, and requires a crummy DLC instead of the GOOD DLC THAT I ALREADY HAVE!!!  The Soroboreans adds more anyway, Three Brothers is just a way to build your own castle and town... after waiting a year or so in-game...</review:description>
