        <review:description>Before the endless wait for Half Life 3, there was the endless wait for FreeSpace 3.

Download Knossos and update the game files. It&apos;s amazing seeing my childhood in HD.

I fly the GTF-05 Valkyrie, full Fury loadout; my black glass cannon.

Mods: I own the original GOTY game disks.</review:description>
