    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/605919a6-aa76-11eb-ace6-fa163e99870e -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/605919a6-aa76-11eb-ace6-fa163e99870e">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-05-01T15:11:36</review:date>
        <review:description>As the blurb says, &apos;“Tonight We Riot” is an unapologetically political, socialist game&apos;, so all it has is a monotonous round of rioting, violence and hate against democracy and Western civilisation.  

It&apos;s as boring and empty as watching the woke totalitarian destruction of the USA and Europe, as the racist bigots usher-in their era of camps and killing fields.</review:description>
