        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2008-10-14T15:21:31</review:date>
        <review:description>MDK is hard. Like, really hard. So hard in fact, I can&apos;t beat the first level. That&apos;s not to say I didn&apos;t enjoy it, it was a lot of fun, but if you&apos;re not up to the challenge, perhaps reconsider this one. Also, don&apos;t have jump and fire on alt and ctrl, it can make the game crash (screen flip).</review:description>
