    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/69ed85fe-f259-11ea-811e-fa163e93294d -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/69ed85fe-f259-11ea-811e-fa163e93294d">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-09-09T08:00:43</review:date>
        <review:description>This is a great RPG that is a blast to play. Huge map, a good many quests, one of the best control setups for a character I&apos;ve come across. Great story, I know some people complain but I enjoyed it. Love the artwork and music. If you want to have fun for hours and hours...Here you go!</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">16</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>69ed85fe-f259-11ea-811e-fa163e93294d</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</review:rating>
        <review:title>Just fun to play</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">35</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/69edf578-c879-11ec-bdb9-fa163e9aa6fa -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/69edf578-c879-11ec-bdb9-fa163e9aa6fa">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2022-04-30T14:33:53</review:date>
        <review:description>Surrender to this interactive story and you&apos;ll be immersed in a well told, strangely compelling who-done-it as gritty Sonny, who uses humour to get through the rough life of an ex-cop. It&apos;s a tight production: the grey world, it&apos;s characters, their history, the unfurling of the plot, the animation, the voice acting and music, the simple interaction and navigation, the puns: it all works together seemlessly. It&apos;s intreguing, not challenging. It good length without outstaying its welcome. Good fun if you want a quieter gaming experience.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>69edf578-c879-11ec-bdb9-fa163e9aa6fa</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</review:rating>
        <review:title>A very fine noir interactive story</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/69f32092-ffce-11e8-86a5-fa163ecdd5fb -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/69f32092-ffce-11e8-86a5-fa163ecdd5fb">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2018-12-14T20:31:04</review:date>
        <review:description>Want an ARPG-style like salt and sanctuary with different items, armors, weapons and stats to level? Well tough luck! This is a generic platformer where you are stuck with your crappy ranged and meelee weapon fort the rest of the game.What is that? Won&apos;t it be linear and boring? of course it will! It&apos;s the worst cash-in of the 21st century! Avoid as the plague. I got bored and uninstalled this game for the PS4 after a few days. The bosses are unfair and tedious and you get no sense of accomplishment when killing a boss and less rewards for it. This is how you DON&apos;T makes a 2D soulsborne game. Save your money, buy salt and sanctuary in stead.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">16</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>69f32092-ffce-11e8-86a5-fa163ecdd5fb</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</review:rating>
        <review:title>Tedious and boring</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">7</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


