        <review:description>First persona camera maybe me deciving, and fools you to start rip and teer, but this way you gona have a realy bad time.
Lisen hero, enemies are endeless, inmortal and powerful. So you have to be clever, cunning and fight only when needed.
This jurney is a trail of mind not the brawl, so treat everything like a puzzle and you will be fine.
