    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/7c070b36-9810-11eb-97e2-fa163e9aa6fa -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/7c070b36-9810-11eb-97e2-fa163e9aa6fa">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-04-08T05:16:53</review:date>
        <review:description>Few people in China have played this game. I was fortunate enough to experience the full version of this game when I first worked, and I played all levels. Now I find a version compatible with windows10 on GOG, re-experiencing the previous fun, and I am very happy.
Now this game on GOG can be saved and read at any time with F2 and F3, which is very convenient.
The rhythm is tight, the shooting is exciting, the creativity is great, and there is always humor. This is my memory of this game before, and now I play this game again, it still feels the same.
在中国很少有人玩到这个游戏，我有幸在刚工作的时候体验到了这个游戏的完整版，而且玩过了全关。现在在GOG上找到兼容windows10的版本，重新体验到以前的乐趣，非常开心。
原来的游戏似乎不能随便存盘，难度比较高。现在GOG上的这个游戏随时可以用F2和F3 存盘和读盘，非常方便。
节奏紧张，射击刺激，创意绝佳，时有幽默，这就是我以前对这个游戏的记忆，现在重新玩玩这个游戏，还是一样的感觉。</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>7c070b36-9810-11eb-97e2-fa163e9aa6fa</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</review:rating>
        <review:title>Very good classic shooting game 非常好的经典射击</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


