        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2012-03-09T10:05:18</review:date>
        <review:description>You don&apos;t need to love space sims to love the Freespace games, it helps though. Like the first  it&apos;s packed with atmosphere and a phenomenal story, the gameplay and controls are a combo that make this game the best in the genre (that&apos;s right Best!). Be sure to find the hi-res mod online so you can set the resolution to anything above 1280x1024.</review:description>
