        <review:description>Game is awesome! I was literally dancing everytime I got correct answers. The only problem can be visual style, it looked great in a trailer, but in real gameplay it can be heavy on your eyes, but thankfully there are some options to change. Personally I would recommend sharp + LCD. Anyway, looking forward for the next game from Lucas Pope!</review:description>
