        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2017-10-13T19:10:24</review:date>
        <review:description>I think this edition of Baldur&apos;s Gate is really good. I have experienced no crashes, plays as well as the original, so it&apos;s a really good update on a classic game. I think a lot of the negative reviews have a lot to do with the fact that some people preferred various mods than the vanilla experience. BG:EE has some of these mods baked into it, so you get an enhanced experience without the crashes that the community mods offer.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">58</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>8df0a82e-b26d-11e8-8e93-00163e97122a</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</review:rating>
        <review:title>Good update on a classic game</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


