        <review:description>I decided not to buy the game, at least until it is massively discounted.

Reason: In former times, you got a manual with every game you bought. Here you have to buy the double priced version of it,to get a manual (according to the &quot;features&quot; list). When I buy some electronic equipment for a similar price in Germany, I could sue the vendor for not giving me a manual.

I think, I am in-line with many comments here.

Vendor: Please take more considerations in pricing, the next time!

I might add more review, when I bought the game ... but ...</review:description>
