        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-04-30T18:19:50</review:date>
        <review:description>While I agree with the ideological message, (that is told through a very forced way) the game itself is just a pretty mediocre beat em up.</review:description>
