        <review:description>This is what the first game should have been like, playable, more connected to the player. I hated the first version, because it was buggy, empty and lifeless. 

If you like highly intellectual, plain weird and challenging games where nothing seems obvious and choices actually matter then it&apos;s THE game or you.</review:description>
