    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/856b51f6-d0d2-11ea-b71b-fa163e62c76a -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/856b51f6-d0d2-11ea-b71b-fa163e62c76a">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-07-28T16:01:58</review:date>
        <review:description>This game is good. It&apos;s not going to blow your mind with super deep story or incredibly deep systems, but it is a good RPG. It is a mobile title at heart, and as such has those limitations, but in general it holds up as well as Eschalon or the Spiderweb titles. it has a decent leveling system where you unlock stats and skills, and if you like classic action RPGs, you will like the game.

Well worth the cost of admission if you&apos;re looking for a fun game that isn&apos;t going to suck up hours and hours of your life.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>856b51f6-d0d2-11ea-b71b-fa163e62c76a</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</review:rating>
        <review:title>Beautiful Android Mobile game come to PC</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">16</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/856429e8-f15a-11e8-bc8e-fa163ecdd5fb -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/856429e8-f15a-11e8-bc8e-fa163ecdd5fb">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2018-11-26T11:06:12</review:date>
        <review:description>This game is one of the first games I played when I got my first PC. I&apos;ve played it many times since then and it always has something new to offer. I&apos;ve even beaten it on the hardest difficulty setting. What I like most about it is the gritty engrossing atmosphere and the game-play. The cut scenes and the NPCs provide amazing voice acting that really adds to the experience. Sometimes they say extremely hilarious lines. It is a classic first person shooter and shooting is as fun as it gets. Do not hesitate, if for whatever reason you&apos;ve never played it, buy it as soon as possible. If you&apos;ve played it - play it again, it still is as fun as you remember it.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>856429e8-f15a-11e8-bc8e-fa163ecdd5fb</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</review:rating>
        <review:title>A classic</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


