    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/8587b69c-8afc-11e9-9f36-00163e4e60cc -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/8587b69c-8afc-11e9-9f36-00163e4e60cc">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2019-06-10T00:21:18</review:date>
        <review:description>Это восхитительная игра. Даже не знаю, как описать. Я не понимаю, почему тут такие низкие оценки. Игра тронула меня до глубины души. Персонажи, подача, саундтрек – всё на высоте!
Я однозначно рекомендую данное произведение всем любителям сюжетно ориентированных игр в целом и интерактивного кино в частности.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>8587b69c-8afc-11e9-9f36-00163e4e60cc</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</review:rating>
        <review:title>Уж не шедевр ли это?</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/86a83af4-c7ec-11eb-a8dc-fa163e9aa6fa -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/86a83af4-c7ec-11eb-a8dc-fa163e9aa6fa">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-06-08T03:00:25</review:date>
        <review:description>What you got here is a 2D twin stick shooter that favours style over substance. The premise is simple. You play as some dude who can see a talking banana (Pedro) who encourages him to go on a gangsters killing spree. That&apos;s it! On top of that, the visuals aren&apos;t much to look at either, leaving you with the game-play. And for any platform shooter fan, this will really scratch the itch. Instead of blasting your way from level to level, the game encourages you to dive, jump and flip while utilising the slow down mechanic. Overall, the fun is in having to pull of these stylish, badarse manoeuvres along with using the environment and array of weapons to your advantage.

I did have fun, it is just different enough to keep me engaged. However, I had to endure multiple crashes again and again. Real shame, because I would have loved to squeeze more out of this. Worth the price if you like your twin stick shooters.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>86a83af4-c7ec-11eb-a8dc-fa163e9aa6fa</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</review:rating>
        <review:title>Silly But Solid</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/86c29cd6-da21-11eb-8955-fa163e99870e -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/86c29cd6-da21-11eb-8955-fa163e99870e">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-07-01T07:05:09</review:date>
        <review:description>Es una secuela decente, añade escudos nuevos para usar y la posibilidad de encantar tus ya conocidas armas al pasar por una piscina mágica que agrega daños elementales. Además, la disponibilidad de hechizos y pociones es muy abundante y sólo tendrás que preocuparte de racionar el hechizo de abrir puertas.

Sin embargo, el diseño de niveles está muy mal balanceado. El primer nivel te entra como una bofetada de todas las características y dificultades que tendrá el juego, dándote ninguna introducción y haciéndolo bastante difícil, y luego, cuando lo superas, el resto es bastante tranquilo.

El arte baja el nivel, pues los enemigos nuevos, una horda de bárbaros, están todos modelados en el limitado CGI de la época, quitándole el encanto de las criaturas hechas a mano del Witchaven original.
</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>86c29cd6-da21-11eb-8955-fa163e99870e</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</review:rating>
        <review:title>Menos criaturas, más bárbaros</review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/86ee63e4-e07b-11e9-86b3-329221c7d32e -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl/review/86ee63e4-e07b-11e9-86b3-329221c7d32e">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/naymoll/ontologies/2022/3/games.owl#Review"/>
        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2019-09-26T16:34:36</review:date>
        <review:description>I&apos;ll keep it short: The game is all about playing through excellent, fun and fluid combat space missions.
It even has a kind of a story that successfully holds the missions together and even player choices in some of them that changes the way the mission then plays.
Oh, and no bugs or crashes.
Enjoy.</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</review:downvotes>
