        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2022-05-28T18:26:56</review:date>
        <review:description>So ... we are the 2022/05/28 and the Steam &amp;amp; GOG verssion have a different build number [2.0.NoEevision for steam &amp;amp; 2.0.141541], but exactly the same content and the same laste update dated on 2021/08/05 = Since DRM are evil, go for the GOG verssion.

The only missing things are the attire DLC who are note avalable on GOG... nothing crucial.

For the game himself, it on of the best cudly toy you can find after a bad workday... it&apos;s an &quot;A&quot; game tough, so there is litlle lack of polish,</review:description>
