        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-11-25T23:03:06</review:date>
        <review:description>DSA (Das schwarze Auge) is a german Classic Paper and Pen RPG.
Drakensang and Drakensang 2 are very good adaptations of that Game.

Deep Characters and Sory,
You can play many variants of a Char / Race / Class. 
The Game often offers many ways to solving a quest and violence is not always the best option. 
</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</review:downvotes>
