        <review:description>For a game centered around identifying plants, I don&apos;t feel like you are really presented with a good enough reference to properly identify them. 

It&apos;s nice that there&apos;s no timer, but it honestly felt more like having to guess with some of the plants. If I had a plant guide this bad IRL, I&apos;d be using it for kindling.</review:description>
