        <review:description>I loved &quot;Indiana Jones and the Infernal Machine&quot; back in 1999, so I bought this version immediatly.

It works flawlessy. I just did the level 7, the Palawan Temple, and there is no bug.

I recommend this videogame to anyone love adventure games.</review:description>
