        <review:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-05-25T19:12:48</review:date>
        <review:description>The plot: the fabula is like all in this sequel based on the original,  there is an evil almighty organisation that controlled by immensly dumb people, which have a problem with   their new moronic  evil plan to use STEM on all people wirelessly))), meanwhile some of their lab rats with twisted imagination for unknown reasons  have great powers in new  version of matrix, it doesn&apos;t matter that the core brain now is   innocent and childish and basically can create new version of OZ, changing habitants into bunnies  and unicorns ,cause she thinks it&apos;s  just a dream . Let&apos;s talk about that propaganda. Our main hero now become a dumb crying girl ,that needs to be saved and taken care by multitude of bad written brave  female  red shirts of different nationalities, cause me too and political correctness comes first, now Sebastian is always motivated by them , cause if not , he drowns himself in self pity and can&apos;t do nothing about it. What an example for every boy to admire and follow his steps.

</review:description>
        <review:downvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">42</review:downvotes>
        <review:id>9363b896-9ea2-11ea-a365-fa163e93294d</review:id>
        <review:rating rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</review:rating>
        <review:title>Shallow    propagandistic game    </review:title>
        <review:upvotes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">14</review:upvotes>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


