        <review:description>I grew tired of Freelancer and opted to give this a try because of the glowing reviews.  It is really good for sure, but I think many of the reviews here tap into that &quot;well It was great when I was younger&quot;.  Best space ship sim is Freelancer,  and its not even close.   This is a very good game still,  but no where near the quality that the people flush it with.</review:description>
