        <review:description>I owned the DRM Free version since Beta release, and still playing now after stable and later releases.

Great game! Always something different happens, great dev. support, you start to hate the game when gets unfair, but surviving is the reason of the game.

I definitively recommend this game for people who like strategy resource survival games!</review:description>
